B)"></video></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic><svg class=chatlog__attachment-generic-icon><use href=#attachment-icon /></svg><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-name><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1468668506760413316/1496782862849146890/Exodus_2013-Bulgarian_Bulgaria.srt?ex=6a2fb12b&amp;is=6a2e5fab&amp;hm=6253f9eef193ac2df550556b6c4cbc062ab8c67331dd1781f9c9ba000afcc717&amp;"> Exodus_2013-Bulgarian_Bulgaria.srt </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-size>9.54 KB</div></div></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><video class=chatlog__attachment-media controls><source src="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1468668506760413316/1496782864077819995/Being_a_Good_Sheppard__trafficking_people.mp4?ex=6a2fb12b&amp;is=6a2e5fab&amp;hm=f9608f4099de3e454ddf80537aaab306a79d393c7bd0450b0cd74101b2a81441&amp;" alt="Video attachment" title="Video: Being_a_Good_Sheppard__trafficking_people.mp4 (4.3 MB)"></video></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1468668506760413316/1496782865138978936/Being_a_Good_Sheppard__trafficking_people.png?ex=6a2fb12b&amp;is=6a2e5fab&amp;hm=519148eeda6c886057da5978d07d6357828508ffe2e87fbb98e57c5e2347607e&amp;"> <img class=chatlog__attachment-media src="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1468668506760413316/1496782865138978936/Being_a_Good_Sheppard__trafficking_people.png?ex=6a2fb12b&amp;is=6a2e5fab&amp;hm=519148eeda6c886057da5978d07d6357828508ffe2e87fbb98e57c5e2347607e&amp;" alt="Image attachment" title="Image: Being_a_Good_Sheppard__trafficking_people.png (1.59 MB)" loading=lazy> </a></div></div></div></div></div>
<div class=chatlog__message-group><div id=chatlog__message-container-1501269979935281343 class=chatlog__message-container data-message-id=1501269979935281343><div class=chatlog__message><div class=chatlog__message-aside><img class=chatlog__avatar src=https://cdn.discordapp.com/embed/avatars/4.png alt=Avatar loading=lazy></div><div class=chatlog__message-primary><div class=chatlog__header><span class=chatlog__author title=dadventuressteve data-user-id=1264035953933156432>Veilocity</span> <span class=chatlog__timestamp title="Tuesday, May 5, 2026 9:10 PM"><a href=#chatlog__message-container-1501269979935281343>5/5/2026 9:10 PM</a></span></div><div class="chatlog__content chatlog__markdown"><span class=chatlog__markdown-preserve><strong>Хората са истинското богатство <img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="&#128173;"
    title="thought_balloon"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1f4ad.svg"><img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="&#127757;"
    title="earth_africa"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1f30d.svg"> 23/03/2026 - Грузия</strong>

След като се отдръпнах от глобалния конфликт, започнах ясно да виждам нещо: хората са истинското богатство. <img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="&#128161;"
    title="bulb"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1f4a1.svg">
И все пак наблюдаваме как страхът, нарастващите разходи и ограниченията фино „сдържат“ и преместват това богатство.

Ако мирът, безопасността и сигурността започват у дома <img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="&#127969;"
    title="house_with_garden"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1f3e1.svg"> – със семейството – защо толкова много хора са насърчавани да ги търсят другаде чрез обещания, заплати или забавени награди?

Тук има противоречие.
Казваме, че хората са най-важни… но системите все още ги разпръскват във вреда.

Може би е време да осъзнаем какво вече сме – и да го защитим. <img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="⚖️"
    title="scales"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/2696.svg"><img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="✨"
    title="sparkles"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/2728.svg">

