<a href="https://vimeo.com/1197260701">https://vimeo.com/1197260701</a></span> <span class=chatlog__edited-timestamp title="Sunday, June 14, 2026 5:51 AM">(edited)</span></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><video class=chatlog__attachment-media controls><source src="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1468668506760413316/1510891279645409320/Lets_Talk_About_Sex-Bulgarian_Bu_caption.mp4?ex=6a2f9a28&amp;is=6a2e48a8&amp;hm=e46641d7e5c149ba7b7846a59af03ef5083132522235e38d0c829840d6bbe96e&amp;" alt="Video attachment" title="Video: Lets_Talk_About_Sex-Bulgarian_Bu_caption.mp4 (86.33 MB)"></video></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic><svg class=chatlog__attachment-generic-icon><use href=#attachment-icon /></svg><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-name><a href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1468668506760413316/1510891289682513930/Lets_Talk_About_Sex-Bulgarian_Bulgaria.srt?ex=6a2f9a2a&amp;is=6a2e48aa&amp;hm=6e97b20332e36d8afbd80eac733125a2fbf03476724aa4846383adfbe549534b&amp;"> Lets_Talk_About_Sex-Bulgarian_Bulgaria.srt </a></div><div class=chatlog__attachment-generic-size>7.49 KB</div></div></div><div class=chatlog__attachment><audio class=chatlog__attachment-media controls><source src="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1468668506760413316/1510891290009796659/Lets_Talk_About_Sex-Bulgarian_Bulg_audio.mp3?ex=6a2f9a2a&amp;is=6a2e48aa&amp;hm=44c7e4270fe538541a8af3c6b35d167145b8958f193bee045a55b8a66fbb3a93&amp;" alt="Audio attachment" title="Audio: Lets_Talk_About_Sex-Bulgarian_Bulg_audio.mp3 (2.3 MB)"></audio></div></div></div></div></div>
<div class=chatlog__message-group><div id=chatlog__message-container-1511023351324348588 class=chatlog__message-container data-message-id=1511023351324348588><div class=chatlog__message><div class=chatlog__message-aside><img class=chatlog__avatar src=https://cdn.discordapp.com/embed/avatars/4.png alt=Avatar loading=lazy></div><div class=chatlog__message-primary><div class=chatlog__header><span class=chatlog__author title=dadventuressteve data-user-id=1264035953933156432>Veilocity</span> <span class=chatlog__timestamp title="Monday, June 1, 2026 7:07 PM"><a href=#chatlog__message-container-1511023351324348588>6/1/2026 7:07 PM</a></span></div><div class="chatlog__content chatlog__markdown"><span class=chatlog__markdown-preserve><strong>Orezivanje sa svjesnošću - ne sa zaboravom <img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="✂️"
    title="scissors"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/2702.svg"><img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="&#128154;"
    title="green_heart"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1f49a.svg"> 13/11/2025 - Turska
</strong>
Svi mi orezujemo svaki dan.
Svaka oslobođena misao.
Svako odbačeno uvjerenje.
Svaka prerasla navika.
Ovako se oblikuje unutrašnji vrt.

Orezivanje nije smrt ega.
To je razlučivanje -
uklanjanje onoga što je dodano kroz strah, uslovljavanje i nasljeđivanje,
kako bi ono što je istinito ponovo moglo disati.

Isus je rekao da Kraljevstvo pripada djeci -
pojačavajući namjeru da se odbaci uslovljavanje
koje nikada nije ni bilo vaše.

Na Posljednjoj večeri, Isus je rekao:
&quot;Ovo je moje tijelo, dato za vas.&quot;

Ovo nije bila uputa za slijepo ponavljanje,
već poziv na sjećanje -
kako bi se spriječilo da značenje ovog načina postojanja nestane.

Sjećanje bez prisutnosti uopće nije sjećanje.
Ritual ponovljen bez svijesti ne poštuje žrtvu -
zaboravlja je.

Kada svjesno orezujemo,
štitimo najvažniji dio sebe...
<img
